WEBVTT

00:00.080 --> 00:04.260
No doctor on board. Only Eva: Super Intelligence, on your wrist.

00:04.150 --> 00:05.625
— I feel alone.

00:05.575 --> 00:07.263
[Eva] I'm here. Let's call home.

00:09.250 --> 00:11.370
Solar storm. Eighteen minutes.

00:11.300 --> 00:12.860
Eva shows the way. Go.

00:13.300 --> 00:15.200
Then Ana's heart stops.

00:15.130 --> 00:16.780
The nearest passenger runs.

00:16.710 --> 00:18.630
The station lights the defibrillator.

00:18.560 --> 00:20.450
Eva paces every push.

00:20.280 --> 00:21.550
[AED] Shock advised.

00:22.850 --> 00:26.810
Eva guides, the AED decides, and Ana breathes.

00:27.100 --> 00:29.760
Eva. Nobody is alone in space.
